### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### Get All Pets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pets
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Create a Pet (for testing purposes)
# @name createPet
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pets
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Buddy",
  "species": "Dog",
  "age": 3,
  "price": 250.00
}

### Extract Pet ID from the create response
@petId = {{createPet.response.body.id}}

### Get Pet by ID (replace with actual ID after creating)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/{{petId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Update Pet (replace with actual ID after creating)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/{{petId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Buddy Updated",
  "species": "Dog",
  "age": 4,
  "price": 300.00
}

### Delete Pet (replace with actual ID after creating)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/{{petId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
